  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Clicking the orb in the designer opens the orb menu on the design surface, including a blank menu with the design-time add buttons when there are no items yet - the same thing the real drop-down shows in design mode. Package metadata now credits WindowsRibbon (https://github.com/harborsiem/WindowsRibbon) and RibbonWinForms. The runtime API is unchanged from 1.0.5-net10.",
